             "color": "#1E3A43"
            }
           },
           "hide": null,
           "html": "<p>Throughout the years, our alumni have played a tremendous part in the success and sustainability of our programs.  We will always be indebted to our community for helping us promote these special opportunities to today's youth.  </p><p>We are committed to helping engage with students past, present, and future and hoping this will serve as a great resource to stay connected with one another moving forward.  </p><p>Let us remember how impactful this program was in our formative years and work together to make sure this program lasts forever.</p>"
          }
