           },
           "hide": null,
           "text": "Durham Family Thoughts",
           "tag": "h3",
           "link": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "text-editor",
           "id": "9dd3f80",
           "style": {
            "> .elementor-widget-container": {
             "padding": "0px 20px 0px 0px"
            },
            "": {
             "font-family": "var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif",
             "color": "#1E3A43"
            }
           },
           "hide": null,
           "html": "<p>The Durham family has been a huge supporter of this program for decades. Starting with four siblings and now with four from the next generation.&nbsp; This is not just a tourist trip to Ireland.&nbsp; This is an opportunity of a lifetime.&nbsp; Traveling to Ireland, learning the history and culture, making new friends, learning self-reliance, and gaining independence are just a few of the benefits.&nbsp; Simply put, this program is priceless.</p>\n<p>Listen to Maureen and give the gift of a lifetime to a special teen in your life!</p>"
          }
