           "hide": null,
           "html": "<p>Have you lost contact with friends from your summer on the Irish Life Experience?</p><p>Over the years, groups have established their own social media pages. If you are having difficulties finding your friends on Instagram and Facebook, please reach out to our team to see if they can help you.</p>"
